cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "MILO: metrology-informed learning from index-coded ordinal labels"
abstract: >-
  Code, run logs and figures for the manuscript "Learning the truth behind
  index-coded labels: metrology-informed neural forecasting with online risk
  control for air-quality warnings". The package contains a NumPy
  reverse-mode automatic-differentiation engine, the MILO-LT, MILO-LD and
  MILO-RC methods, the baselines and ablations, the experiment grid (672
  trained networks on daily ISPU records of five Jakarta stations,
  2010-2025), aggregated tables and Figures 1-7.
authors:
